# SPA fallback — all routes serve /index.html so React Router handles
# client-side routing. This is the standard Netlify/Cloudflare/Render
# compatible rewrite baked into the build output. Without it, deep links
# like /events or /venue/check-in/123 return HTTP 404 from the static host.
#
# Order matters: rules are evaluated top-down, first match wins.
#   200 = rewrite and serve with HTTP 200.
/*    /index.html   200